    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the chaos of civilisation.</strong> <br>Race wars, political coups, and full-blown riots, it\u2019s all part of the simulation. Citizens aren\u2019t just peaceful little people anymore. They can protest, become radical, or turn your city into ashes overnight. Will you rule with mercy or crush anyone against you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-hungry politicians will fight for control.</strong> <br>They\u2019ll demand new laws, more freedom, or worse, total dominance. Will you bend to their will, or erase them from existence so they never rise again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Implement taxes, and policies.</strong> <br>You are their leader. Their president. Their God. Keep them happy or face mass unrest. Angry mobs will destroy your city if you ignore their cries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bobbies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every citizen race is bobbies, they call themself bobbies and you will too. Every little citizen will have their own feelings, and act based on those feelings. they will also learn by making choices, either bad or guilty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The danger around the corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countrys can declare war on you and you can on them. Invest in military or you would have to hire private military, and that isnt cheap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa God Simulator - You controll the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Deep Society Simulation \u2013 Citizens have emotions, needs, and beliefs. One upset Bobby can trigger a revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Dynamic Politics \u2013 Watch kingdoms rise and fall. Support a side or let the world burn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Racial Conflict \u2013 Prejudice and hate can divide your world, or you can fight it with unity and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Trade - Trade and sell, you can either buy from countrys with alot of factorys or you can be the one with factorys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Build &amp; Shape \u2013 Design cities, terraform land, craft wonders, or unleash destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Absolute Chaos \u2013 Riots, meteor showers, nukes Everything is possible and everything can destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own civilisation. <br>Or destroy it in the most ridiculous way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the chaos of civilisation.</strong> <br>Race wars, political coups, and full-blown riots, it\u2019s all part of the simulation. Citizens aren\u2019t just peaceful little people anymore. They can protest, become radical, or turn your city into ashes overnight. Will you rule with mercy or crush anyone against you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-hungry politicians will fight for control.</strong> <br>They\u2019ll demand new laws, more freedom, or worse, total dominance. Will you bend to their will, or erase them from existence so they never rise again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Implement taxes, and policies.</strong> <br>You are their leader. Their president. Their God. Keep them happy or face mass unrest. Angry mobs will destroy your city if you ignore their cries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bobbies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every citizen race is bobbies, they call themself bobbies and you will too. Every little citizen will have their own feelings, and act based on those feelings. they will also learn by making choices, either bad or guilty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The danger around the corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countrys can declare war on you and you can on them. Invest in military or you would have to hire private military, and that isnt cheap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa God Simulator - You controll the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Deep Society Simulation \u2013 Citizens have emotions, needs, and beliefs. One upset Bobby can trigger a revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Dynamic Politics \u2013 Watch kingdoms rise and fall. Support a side or let the world burn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Racial Conflict \u2013 Prejudice and hate can divide your world, or you can fight it with unity and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Trade - Trade and sell, you can either buy from countrys with alot of factorys or you can be the one with factorys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Build &amp; Shape \u2013 Design cities, terraform land, craft wonders, or unleash destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Absolute Chaos \u2013 Riots, meteor showers, nukes Everything is possible and everything can destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own civilisation. <br>Or destroy it in the most ridiculous way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
